      "content": "oh okay i think i get the difference. so for the maillard thing, is there any way to speed it up or control it more precisely? like if im trying to get a really specific crust color on a loaf of sourdough, what factors should i be looking at? i didnt realize it was mostly just about the amino acids and sugars.",
